--- !u!114 &9850000000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 987192584}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 48b86620b0fc4ec2b56357675feb1ac5, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GameJamPlus.UI.DialogueManager
  hud: {fileID: 1278549803}
  defaultEnding:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "Excellent. We can consider this test complete."
    duration: 7
  welcome:
    avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d43949e9434a9b34ebb39592a7ac0cb6, type: 3}
    messages:
    - "Welcome to Universe-{universe}. Relax and enjoy your stay."
    duration: 7
  piranha:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "How sociable! You have already made friends with the fish. Let us take a break now."
    - "I see you have found some new aquatic friends. I would say you have socialized enough for today!"
    duration: 7
  starvation:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "A healthy, balanced diet is the foundation of a long life."
    - "Meals are very important. Let us remember that for the next stage."
    duration: 7
  drowning:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "A break to catch your breath is always a good idea."
    - "Let us remind the subject to breathe between exercises."
    duration: 7
  lowOxygen:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "Excellent concentration! Let us remember to breathe, though."
    - "A quick trip to the surface helps keep the mind clear."
    duration: 7
  cheeseGoal:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "Excellent appetite! That is enough cheese for this trial. Time for a well-earned rest."
    - "Ten portions already! What a healthy appetite. We can conclude this trial here."
    duration: 7
  cheeseCollected:
    avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d43949e9434a9b34ebb39592a7ac0cb6, type: 3}
    messages:
    - "Excellent choice. Some cheese to keep exploring."
    - "Cheese collected. Let us see what you find in the next room."
    - "A small reward for your curiosity."
    - "I see you have made yourself comfortable. Keep it up!"
    duration: 7
  poisoned:
    avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d43949e9434a9b34ebb39592a7ac0cb6, type: 3}
    messages:
    - "Good, very good. It is time to rest."
    - "Yes, I think a nap is just what you need."
    - "Oh, going to sleep already? What a shame..."
    duration: 7
  photoGoal:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "Three photographs already? Such curiosity! We had better take a break now."
    - "You have seen quite enough for today. Let us give that curious mind a rest."
    - "What an inquisitive little mouse. Further observation will not be necessary."
    duration: 7
  fallDeath:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "Interesting. The subject has decided to explore gravity personally."
    - "A very convincing descent. I would say we have earned a break."
    - "Excellent, the descent stage is complete too. Let us rest for a moment."
    duration: 7
  goal:
    avatar: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d43949e9434a9b34ebb39592a7ac0cb6, type: 3}
    messages:
    - "You found the way out! Excellent navigation. Your trial is complete; enjoy a well-deserved rest."
    - "Splendid! Another successful journey through the maze. We can conclude this trial here."
    duration: 7
  electricShock:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "Ah, a passion for science and electricity. I know that irresistible temptation."
    duration: 7
  mouseTrap:
    avatar: {fileID: 0}
    messages:
    - "That should not have been there! Clean room seven."
    duration: 7
